{"parse":{"title":"个性/傲视","pageid":3303,"revid":7162,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E5%82%B2%E8%A7%86&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E5%82%B2%E8%A7%86&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E5%82%B2%E8%A7%86&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>傲视</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.82.B2.E8.A7.86\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"傲视\"><b>傲视</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 傲视.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d9/5er8jaoa2zlgrc17kpmd1oy3t4d66si.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E5%82%B2%E8%A7%86.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d9/5er8jaoa2zlgrc17kpmd1oy3t4d66si.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E5%82%B2%E8%A7%86.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d9/5er8jaoa2zlgrc17kpmd1oy3t4d66si.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />傲视\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>物攻提高<font color=\"red\">5%</font>，物防提高<font color=\"red\">5%</font>。行动结束时，若自身处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"健康\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">健康</font></span></span>]状态及在敌人威胁范围内，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">傲视</span>]，效果：受到伤害降低<font color=\"red\">20%</font>，持续<font color=\"red\">1</font>回合，效果冷却<font color=\"red\">3</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%AA%81%E5%87%BB%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E2%80%9C%E7%A5%9E%E9%97%AA%E2%80%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/突击骑士“神闪”\"><img alt=\"头像 突击骑士“神闪”.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3b/0zfkmwct434agp3p21pir0dk42aemsy.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">突击骑士“神闪”</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></t